{
    "id":  2824,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "LED Bulb ED90 40W for Streetlight | E27 Socket High Resistance | 300º",
    "reference":  "FLB40WS2",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e40W LED lamp\u003c/strong\u003e of \u003cstrong\u003eHIGH RESISTANCE\u003c/strong\u003e specifically designed for a very efficient heat dissipation, specifically designed for industrial use and lighting of large spaces, has a high power factor (+0.95) high energy conversion and low maintenance costs. \u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eLED Bulb ED90 40W for Streetlight | E27 Socket High Resistance | 300º\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e40W LED lamp\u003c/strong\u003e of \u003cstrong\u003ehigh resistance\u003c/strong\u003e and durability specifically designed for large areas, with a high power factor (+0.95), high energy conversion and low maintenance costs. It offers instant start-up, dedicating all the energy consumed to the creation of light. The energy savings achieved enable a rapid return on the initial investment. Long life, robustness and high resistance to vibrations.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eOur heavy-duty bulb is available in several light colours\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAmber (1800ºK).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWarm white (3000ºK),\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNeutral white (4000ºK),\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCool white (6500ºK)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eOur \u003cstrong\u003ebulb\u003c/strong\u003e has a novel and stylised design in the shape of a tulip or magnolia. With this design, a 360º angle of light is achieved, and at the same time a very efficient evacuation of the heat generated by the LED.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe bulb has a self-protection system that intelligently adjusts the power when the recommended temperature is exceeded for greater efficiency.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eApplications LED Lamp 40W E27 - H\u003cstrong\u003eigh Resistance\u003c/strong\u003e:\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSupermarkets and indoor garages.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStreet lamps.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShops and shops in general.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWorkshops and warehouses.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReplaces 125W E40 halogen bulbs and 250W E40 sodium vapour bulb.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAny indoor area with high ceilings or large spaces.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://www.factorled.com/img/cms/Ambientadas/Brazo-Soporte-Farola-Led.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"394\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"gtx-trans\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gtx-trans-icon\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
